> **Create a User base [[class|class]], and Create Student, Lecturer, and Admin classes that inherit from User base [[class|class]]. Demonstrate how an [[object|object]] of each derived [[class|class]] can use: Methods from the [[parent-[[class|class]]|parent [[class|class]]]], Its own specific methods.**

