## Section 8 — Best Practices

| Practice | Reason |
|----------|--------|
| **Catch specific** | Avoid catching `[[exception|exception]]` broadly |
| **Don't swallow** | Log or re-[[throw|throw]]; empty catch hides bugs |
| **Use [[finally|finally]]/try-with-resources** | Prevent resource leaks |
| **Custom exceptions** | [[domain|domain]]-specific, carry context |
| **[[fail-fast|fail fast]]** | Validate early, [[throw|throw]] descriptive exceptions |
| **Document** | Javadoc `@[[throws|throws]]` for checked exceptions |

