# COS 201 Track B: Java OOP — Topic 6
# Collections & [[generics|generics]]

## The Central Idea

The **[[collections-framework|collections framework]]** provides ready-to-use data structures ([[list|list]], [[set|set]], [[map|map]], [[queue|queue]]). **[[generics|generics]]** add [[type-safety|type safety]] to collections, eliminating casts and catching errors at compile time.

