### Buffered Copy (Fast)
```java
try ([[bufferedinputstream|bufferedinputstream]] in = new [[bufferedinputstream|bufferedinputstream]](new [[fileinputstream|fileinputstream]]("src.dat"));
     [[bufferedoutputstream|bufferedoutputstream]] out = new [[bufferedoutputstream|bufferedoutputstream]](new [[fileoutputstream|fileoutputstream]]("dest.dat"))) {
